{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"警方聯同慈善組織舉行越野挑戰賽\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-01-11-15-56bhC0W3mm.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】警方聯同慈善組織舉行越野挑戰賽，起步禮上午在油塘三家村遊樂場舉行。</p><p>保安局副局長卓孝業、警務處處長周一鳴等人出席起步禮。活動由苗圃行動及警方主辦，設有42公里、28公里、14公里及3公里不同距離越野挑戰賽，亦有多個紀律部隊及政府部門組隊參賽，為弱勢兒童籌款。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:27.785846+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T03:08:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T08:58:24.992070+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:32.617050+00:00","content_hash":"2b0c1b1a1da98f5ef7afbab6a94a271b1d2d29a66c28a50f6ae9924338b98e71","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}